        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "\n        2 Ilai 22.1–23.30; 2 Int 34.1–35.27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Ele rorei lo Laitoriani oewuo enetii Sefania olayioni le Kushi, olayioni le Gedalia, olayioni le Amaria, olayioni le Hesekia, too nkolongi e Yosia ilo ayioni le Amon, olaiguanani le Yuda.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEP.1.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEP.1.1"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Enkolong e nkiguana o Laitoriani",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEP 1:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEP.1.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEP.1.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEP 1:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Kajutu nanu tukul pooki toki aiwuang'ie ti oriong enkop,” Olaitoriani ojo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEP.1.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEP.1.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEP 1:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Kajutu nanu tung'ani o eng'ues; kajutu nanu aiwuang'ie ntaritik o loing'ang'e o sinkir le naiposha. Kanang'aa nanu aiturraa lelo torrok; kaishie nanu iltung'ana, aiwuang'ie ti oriong e nkop,” Olaitoriani ojo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEP.1.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEP.1.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEP 1:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEP.1.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEP.1.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEP 1:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Kaitorioo nanu enkaina ai aarare Yuda, naarare sii lelo pooki oomanya Yerusalem; naa kaishie nanu aiwuang'ie tene wueji ilo pisiai le Baal o ina arna e lelo apolosak ooserem nkitanyaanyukot; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEP.1.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEP.1.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEP 1:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "lelo ooirrugokino too nchumat oo nkajijik olorora le shumata; lelo ooirrugo neinosie Olaitoriani olmumai neitoki ake sii aainos olmumai te nkarna e nkai naji Milkom; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEP.1.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEP.1.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEP 1:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "lelo ooibelekenyate ootapala esujata o Laitoriani, lelo lemeing'oru Olaitoriani anaa eikilikuanishore ninye.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEP.1.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEP.1.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEP 1:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEP.1.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEP.1.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEP 1:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ntirring'ayu te dukuya olaitoriani Enkai! Amu etataana enkolong o Laitoriani; eitobira Olaitoriani olasar neitisinya ilomon lenyena. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEP.1.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEP.1.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEP 1:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naa ore te ina olong o lasar lo Laitoriani, “Kaitame nanu lelo kituaak o lelo ayiok lo laiguanani o lelo pooki ooishopote too nkilani oo loreren. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEP.1.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEP.1.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEP 1:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore te ina olong naitame nanu lelo pooki ooseremisho anaa iltung'ana lemeyiolo Enkai lelo oopurrisho near iltung'ana metuata pee etumi aaiputa nkajijik o lkitok lenye iyarunot.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEP.1.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEP.1.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEP 1:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEP.1.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEP.1.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEP 1:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Ore akenya te ina olong,” Olaitoriani ojo, “naa kening'i olkiyioi teina Kishomi o Sinkirri, eyietunoto e nkishirata naing'uaa Endung'oto e Are, esulunoto kitok too ldoinyo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEP.1.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEP.1.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEP 1:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Enteyietu enchira intae iloomanya Motar! Amu meekure eetae ilbiasharani; ore lelo pooki ooipim enkosholai nedungori aaiwuangie.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEP.1.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEP.1.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEP 1:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEP.1.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEP.1.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEP 1:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Ore akenya te ina olong naa kajur nanu Yerusalem too ltaai, naa kaitame nanu lelo tung'ana ooishiligate te okoto e naisho enye, oojo too ltauja lenye, ‘Meas Olaitoriani esidai nemeas entorrono.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEP.1.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEP.1.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEP 1:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kerayae imasaa enye, neitomijooni nkajijik enye. Ore hoo neshet ninche nkajijik memany ninche; ore hoo neun ninche nkurman oo sabibu meok ninche enaisho enye.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEP.1.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEP.1.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEP 1:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEP.1.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEP.1.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEP 1:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore ina olong kitok o Laitoriani netinyikua, etinyikua naa kesieku; kedua oltoilo le ina olong o Laitoriani, keyietu aishir oltung'ani magilani te ine. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEP.1.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEP.1.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEP 1:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Enkolong e ngoro napi ina olong, enkolong o sina o emion, enkolong e nkidaata o emutata, enkolong e naimin o enkimuntut",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEP.1.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEP.1.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1.15",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "enkimuntut",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "enkata nemeetae enchipai - enkisuuto",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ", enkolong oo nkatampo o enaimin nagut, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEP.1.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEP.1.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEP 1:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "enkolong e oshoto e ntarumpeta o lkiyioi lo larrabal, egilunore nena anas naasheta isunta negilunore iltaleta lo larrabal.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEP.1.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEP.1.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEP 1:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEP.1.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEP.1.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEP 1:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kayau nanu osina shumata iltung'ana, o metaa kepuo ninche anaa ilmodook, enkaraki nataasa ninche eng'oki ti alo Olaitoriani; keibukori osarge lenye anaa enterit, neikoni inkiri oo seseni lenye anaa emodioi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEP.1.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEP.1.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEP 1:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEP.1.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEP.1.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEP 1:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mekordu ninche enkosholai enye aashu sahabu enye te ina olong e ngoro o Laitoriani. Ore ti atua enkima e ina goro enye o lom, keinosi aamut enkop pooki; amu te nkiting'oto nara ee enkiting'oto naluamisho keiting'ie ninye asioki lelo pooki oomanya enkop.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEP.1.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEP.1.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
